        medium: 'Adjusts ranges based on the number of hole cards. Understands the 8-or-better low qualifier.',
        hard: 'Optimal range model for each of the six possible die outcomes. Calculates complex equity distributions for 6-card multiway pots.',
      },
      considerations: [
        'Must implement six distinct game states based on the D6 result.',
        'Requires high-performance combinatorial hand evaluation for 6-card hands.',
      ],
